      "description": {
        "en": "When there are 1 or 2 Nihility characters other than Acheron in the team, the DMG dealt by Acheron's Basic ATK, Skill, and Ultimate increases to #1[i]% or #2[i]% of the original DMG respectively.",
        "zh-CN": "我方队伍中存在1名/2名除黄泉之外的「虚无」命途角色时，使黄泉普攻、战技、终结技造成的伤害为原伤害的#1[i]%/#2[i]%。"
